label Call
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	UncleMario: Oh hello? What is it again? You need more stock? Just give me the list and I'll bring it to you soon.
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	UncleMario: Uy, [i]anak[/i]! Stock running low already? [pause=0.4] Don't worry, Uncle's got you covered. What do you need today?
else:
	UncleMario: Hello? [pause=0.6] [shake rate=20 level=10]*hawn*[/shake]... [pause=0.4] Oh, it's you. I was just about to have my second coffee. Tell me what you need so I can get moving.

[end_timeline]

label Busy
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	UncleMario: Oy, aren't you busy right now? Serve that customer first before telling me what you need. Call me back when the counter is clear.
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	UncleMario: Huy! You have a customer waiting, [i]anak[/i]. [pause=0.4] Multi-tasking is good, but don't ignore the people in front of you. Call me later!
else:
	UncleMario: Focus, kid! The customer is waiting. I can hang on, but they might not. I'll stay by the phone, just call again when you're done.
[end_timeline]

label CallRest
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	UncleMario: Look, I just delivered to you recently... I'm still resting! Call back after you've served some more customers!
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	UncleMario: Pang-ilan na 'to? I'm currently having my merienda. Give me a few more minutes to breathe, sige?
else:
	UncleMario: Wait lang, I'm refilling my own stomach right now. Serve more customers while I recharge my tricycle's gas and my own energy!
[end_timeline]

label Delivery
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	UncleMario: Here are the items you requested! I put the items on their respective places... Close the shop soon so you can rest.
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	UncleMario: Delivery is here! Everything's stocked up. Stay alert, okay? The night is still young, but don't overwork.
else:
	UncleMario: Alright, here's your order. I've placed them where they belong. [pause=0.5] Don't work too hard, [i]anak[/i]. See you around!
[end_timeline]